"顶部只使用最小化。点击查看实验功能的限制和关闭后的行为。" = "The top edge uses minimization. Click for limitations and what happens when you turn it off.";
"关闭：只在当前桌面收放。开启：允许激活窗口时切换到它所在的桌面，不搬动窗口的桌面归属。推荐把应用分配给所有桌面。" = "Off: act only on this desktop. On: activating a window may switch to its desktop without moving it between desktops. Assigning the app to All Desktops is recommended.";
"macOS 和许多应用会限制窗口移出屏幕顶部。\n\n当前顶部收放只使用系统最小化：仅收起目标窗口，悬停顶部对应区段或按快捷键可恢复，移开鼠标后按离开延迟再次收起。\n\n关闭后，应用方向菜单不再提供“顶部”，已有顶部绑定暂停收起，已收起的窗口仍可召回。标题条方案暂时停用。" = "macOS and many applications prevent windows from moving above the screen.\n\nThe top edge currently minimizes only the target window. Hover over its top edge segment or press its shortcut to restore it. Moving away hides it after the hide delay.\n\nWhen off, Top is removed from direction menus. Existing top bindings stop hiding; already hidden windows can still be restored. The title bar method is currently disabled.";
"关闭：只在当前桌面收放。\n\n开启：Hover 或快捷键可能切走当前桌面，转到窗口所在的桌面。不会把窗口搬到当前桌面；能否切换由 macOS 决定。\n\n推荐：Dock 中右键目标应用 → 选项 → 分配给 → 所有桌面。" = "Off: act only on this desktop.\n\nOn: hover or a shortcut may switch to the window's desktop. It does not move the window to this desktop. macOS controls whether the switch succeeds.\n\nRecommended: right-click the app in the Dock → Options → Assign To → All Desktops.";
